        "<li><b>Failure with Hieracium:</b> At the urging of botanist Carl N&auml;geli, Mendel attempted to replicate his results in the hawkweed (<i>Hieracium</i>), which reproduces by asexual apomixis (parthenogenesis), thereby failing to show Mendelian segregation.</li>"
