        "<li><b>Donkey (<i>Equus asinus</i>):</b> <code>2n = 62</code>. (Hybrid Mule = 63 chromosomes; sterile).</li>"
        "<li><b>Pig (<i>Sus scrofa</i>):</b> <code>2n = 38</code> (12 pairs metacentric/submetacentric + 6 pairs acrocentric + XX/XY).</li>"
